## Known Gaps / Follow-Up Items

| Gap ID | Description | Impact | Suggested Fix |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| GAP-01 | Find Rooms frontend uses hard-coded mock data instead of calling `/api/rooms/search`. | Search results may not match database availability. | Replace mock result assignment with a `fetch` call to the backend search endpoint. |
| GAP-02 | Room Details frontend uses hard-coded schedule data instead of calling `/api/rooms/<id>/schedule`. | Room schedules may not match uploaded CSV data. | Fetch schedule data using the selected room ID and day. |
| GAP-03 | Backend admin upload route does not use `require_admin`. | Direct API calls can upload data without verified admin authorization. | Apply `@require_admin` to `upload_semester` and send bearer token from the frontend. |
| GAP-04 | CSV upload inserts duplicate rooms even though `room_code` is unique. | Uploads can fail or create incomplete schedule imports. | Use upsert/select existing room before schedule insert. |
